# =====================================================================
# ai-training — SCORM training modules
# Git holds finished SCORM packages (*-scorm.zip), docs and
# hand-written HTML module sources. Other source files (PowerPoints,
# .story, .cptx, iSpring projects, media, exports) stay on the team's
# shared drive, not in git.
# =====================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Allowlist: inside any folder, ignore everything except
# finished packages and README files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
/*/**
!/*/**/
!**/README.md
!**/*-scorm.zip
# Hand-written HTML module sources (index.html + assets/), so changes
# can be diffed and rebuilt. Decks and media stay ignored (see below).
!/modules/*/sources/*/index.html
!/modules/*/sources/*/assets/**
# Module-building docs (Markdown only) and the module starter template.
!/documentation/**/*.md
!/templates/module-starter/**
# Shared module core (SCORM runtime), build/check scripts and CI workflows.
!/templates/core/**
!/tools/**
!/.github/workflows/**
# Audio stays on the shared drive (narration, voice drafts), except the
# short sfx-* sounds a module's index.html plays.
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aac
*.ogg
*.oga
*.opus
*.flac
*.wma
*.aif
*.aiff
!/modules/*/sources/*/assets/sfx-*.mp3
!/templates/module-starter/assets/sfx-*.mp3
# Video stays on the shared drive too, even inside a module's assets/
# (for example the Foundations CEO welcome video, ceo-welcome.webm).
# Copy it into assets/ locally before building the package.
*.webm
*.mkv
*.m4v
*.avi
# Shared Claude Code skills for this repo
!.claude/skills/**

# Build scratch folders are never committed, even if they hold a zip
dist/
build/
out/
publish/
published/
output/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Learner / LMS data — never commit (FERPA)
# Completion reports, gradebook exports, SCORM Cloud / LMS registration
# and tracking data can contain student or staff PII.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
reports/
lms-exports/
learner-data/
registrations/
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*_tracking.json
*_registrations.json
# Exception: made-up sample data only
!**/sample-data/*.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / LMS & SCORM Cloud credentials
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
credentials.json
scormcloud.config.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source files at the repo root (folders are covered above)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.pptm
*.potx
*.ppsx
*.story
*.cptx
*.mp4
*.mov
*.bak
*.tmp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS & editor files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
